msgid "⟪k:0⟫More... ⟪k:1⟫I need... ⟪k:2⟫I need more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais... ⟪k:1⟫eu preciso... ⟪k:2⟫eu preciso de mais..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_73ED03DA_8312_4CD3_8143_2A66A23CB002
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
